karchiver (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Safe extraction: staging directory, path/symlink verification,
    maximum size limit.
  * Desktop integration: .desktop file, MIME types, file manager actions.
  * Supports tar, zip, 7z, rar, cab, lha, deb and common compressors.

